Value LOCAL_INTERFACE ([A-Za-z]{2}\d\S*)
Value REM_ID (\d+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (\S+)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (.*?)

Start
  ^Interface\s+RemID -> Next
  ^-+ -> Next
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${REM_ID}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${PORT_ID}\s+${SYSTEM_NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${REM_ID}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${PORT_ID}\s*$$ -> Record
